  "title": [
    "[Elemental Confluence]"
  ],
  "description": [
    "A full panorama of the elemental destruction is laid out below the lofty aerial point situated atop a high peak.  The devastating geological carnage is in a continual state of changeover and metamorphosis, painting a variegated portrait of the battling raw, natural forces.  To the other side, oppressive waves of rippling fire course through a hidden vale, burning away the corporeal until nothing is left but ash."
  ],
